	(text "The amp: a MAX98357A, as on the HDD Synth MK5 (its amplifier sheet), on GPIO 26-28.\nSD_MODE high (R40, or GPIO 29 high) plays the left channel; the firmware sends the same\nsample on both. GPIO 29 low shuts it down (silence without hiss).\nGAIN open: 9 dB. R61, not fitted, takes it to GND: a solder bridge (0R) for 12 dB, 100k for 15 dB."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
